<title>SINGAPORE: India's Bharat Petroleum to restart cracker Feb 19.</title>
<headline>India's Bharat Petroleum to restart cracker Feb 19.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian state-refiner Bharat Petroleum Corporation Ltd plans to restart its 900,000 tonnes-per-year (18,000-barrel-per-day) cracker February 19, a company source said on Monday.</p>
<p>The unit was originally scheduled to shut down January 9 for a forty-day maintenance, the source said.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
